---

<section class="section" id="problem">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="kicker">The Problem</div>
      <h2>Most EHRs weren't built for solo chiropractors.</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        Large-clinic software tends to come with high costs, bloated workflows, and features independent
        practices will never use. When you're building a practice on your own, that kind of software doesn't
        just feel excessive—it gets in the way.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="problem-grid">
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="pain-list">
          <div class="pain-item">
            <div class="pain-icon">1</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Too much complexity.</strong><br />
              Traditional systems assume layers of staff, complicated workflows, and enterprise-style needs.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pain-item">
            <div class="pain-icon">2</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Too much cost.</strong><br />
              Small practices end up paying for features they don't use and overhead they can't justify.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pain-item">
            <div class="pain-icon">3</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Not built for chiropractic.</strong><br />
              Generic healthcare software rarely fits how chiropractors actually document and operate.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel quote-card">
        <p class="quote">
          "You shouldn't need big-clinic software to build an independent practice."
        </p>
        <div class="quote-meta">
          Grit exists to bring clarity and confidence to chiropractors building something of their own.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding: 36px 0;
  }

  .section-header {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .kicker {
    color: var(--ember);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .section-copy {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.72;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .panel {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.028), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.018));
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 28px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .pain-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .pain-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 30px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: start;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .pain-icon {
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--ember-soft);
    color: var(--ember);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .quote-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(56, 56, 56, 0.9), rgba(48, 48, 48, 0.9));
  }

  .quote {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .quote-meta {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1040px) {
    .problem-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .panel {
      padding: 22px;
    }
  }
</style>
